      "id": 197,
      "text": "dynamic difficulty, yeah. We explored the immense responsibility"
    },
    {
      "id": 198,
      "text": "of being your own bank, guarding those 12 mathematically generated seed words and managing hardware wallets."
    },
    {
      "id": 199,
      "text": "And we mapped out exactly how Joe sends Alice 100,000 Satoshis without a middleman. It empowers you as a user."
    }
